{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:07:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_ef33a2981a9b4133bc896ec929d9d310","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_12c5c4229190e5f94a6a6c4c22a3841cfc4f3c8ace3ee99e1a065d0199f9e961","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"jcz2020/par@4b593db4465d snapshot 8335b6fb3b4903ae","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5c28f936c829072ac985c17ad4527161bfa61ac2e6af2438696f77008c44e77b","slc_eb75bed3c53cab37155bfa902487bb285ec8096149f1f9dd55067be0c81a0ac1","slc_ec75963c13a1f0625dd1a8889bd4f22e6a8495ce2b1d1801cb3073db7ed6a2a8","slc_ecb562ba4c882983770915380b5c9445474a50146879c94102ba3443c652b6b5","slc_fe1cc66b6f558da84b8cdb8b136b46a7547c1b8b6c6f8f2ff4e7c59b8b8206ec"],"source_ids":["src_780362ef2015543c9569170ae5c9bee0"],"text":"Skills are markdown files under ~/.par/skills/<id>/skill.md with YAML frontmatter (schema_version, id, trigger, tool_filter, system_prompt_override), auto-discovered and activated by Auto, Manual, or Keyword triggers.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:07:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ef33a2981a9b4133bc896ec929d9d310"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:07:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_ef33a2981a9b4133bc896ec929d9d310","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_17efa93249569ba14f7061a5f1ff973c4d021c391ed930da6aa077a7e5358c4d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"jcz2020/par@4b593db4465d snapshot 8335b6fb3b4903ae","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_e64814214477986caf23e9ba94801fb35f3ab21c70f313763754c26918363ff1","slc_e79d751625282d6d47d69f67d58b0977430d715786543577e265d07ed9e1c296"],"source_ids":["src_05660ddbffd15a3db280352d74b41505"],"text":"PAR is described as a modular, type-safe agent runtime written in OCaml, usable from Python or OCaml, positioned as a LangChain/LangGraph-style framework.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:07:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ef33a2981a9b4133bc896ec929d9d310"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:07:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_ef33a2981a9b4133bc896ec929d9d310","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_287d7a6bdf205125f9a6aebb9a620f644db55db6c308a7ac2a3f10a5cb69631a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"jcz2020/par@4b593db4465d snapshot 8335b6fb3b4903ae","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0abc60df6f27fff211908e233c4a6092be9336e7eddcf5a447b64afc65871d4d","slc_684c7b913007d5bb342e831b49e40d3ef0c496b78e46e9b60920f4da5df4f384"],"source_ids":["src_abf0d85fbb36593aa2b315e287eb9f3e"],"text":"The bash tool uses a command ADT with no raw-shell constructor, so shell injection is claimed to be unrepresentable at the type level; duplicate tool names return an error rather than overwriting.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:07:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ef33a2981a9b4133bc896ec929d9d310"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:07:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_ef33a2981a9b4133bc896ec929d9d310","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_38b3b614dd6b2158cdac338005f9ced0ecc5692948609452d83720acd17ceea6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"jcz2020/par@4b593db4465d snapshot 8335b6fb3b4903ae","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b08fed8174f32eee2a9b895a45a151da7f196c09baa5c2f46ce7592708764783","slc_f6096d0ab63a2558d76f00f261ede0c1da6817a8f3ecbde3947845769c8cfd8d"],"source_ids":["src_abf0d85fbb36593aa2b315e287eb9f3e"],"text":"The codebase is layered into core (types, runtime, ReAct engine, workflow engine, cancellation, persistence writer), providers (OpenAI, Anthropic, mock), tools, persistence, event bus, and middleware modules.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:07:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ef33a2981a9b4133bc896ec929d9d310"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:07:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_ef33a2981a9b4133bc896ec929d9d310","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3d9ff12e2445ecbd994c1603fa82082ec7f8dd89782e87f5f7adb0b3b85b19ba","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"jcz2020/par@4b593db4465d snapshot 8335b6fb3b4903ae","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2aed05179c66e14a519efe47d74133701bd1aa5ded51f8df383daf2675f59f32","slc_40be6a4b7afdf48d76baf8cd85c4ff87790e346134621318f63ce8c1189b6b23","slc_a2a9aa9c3af70a1c43c00824450b874686ffee44c94b86960e52d62d4f812267"],"source_ids":["src_05660ddbffd15a3db280352d74b41505"],"text":"PAR builds on OCaml 5.4 effects, the Eio concurrency library, and dune, and is MIT-licensed; Python bindings are published on PyPI.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:07:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ef33a2981a9b4133bc896ec929d9d310"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:07:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_ef33a2981a9b4133bc896ec929d9d310","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4594211eef566e525b89c7fe4560ec6c21a9052567f49a20c1ef8211caec6d1b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"jcz2020/par@4b593db4465d snapshot 8335b6fb3b4903ae","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_72d0e522ca84dc63845b361ef4fa5ce0ebb65285a945cb50e3438a9da885c723","slc_b1c8ce21b766928957cd15bce4d2bf3b2d34c00fd31f0fcf05a357f746d009b8"],"source_ids":["src_780362ef2015543c9569170ae5c9bee0"],"text":"Skill markdown bodies are lazy-loaded only on activation, and total skill description tokens are capped at 2048 by default via skill_token_budget, dropping lowest-priority descriptions with a warning.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:07:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ef33a2981a9b4133bc896ec929d9d310"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:07:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_ef33a2981a9b4133bc896ec929d9d310","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4e6d0dcfda74efaaaa32a88ce824bed5daef8bfe4a891d2b072463f372f747a9","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"jcz2020/par@4b593db4465d snapshot 8335b6fb3b4903ae","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_000d5211b3c128b5ca17924525251ace265a8c181b280f87b791d5048056db8f","slc_55c27ded1c6fcdecc4a006d96692c9b0e5a3770eeb9950a3e5c5eaa7e8cc5857","slc_8667d07ddec0bef69ada6a11bf07dccaea87bbfa3c80123be478d1eeba7102e2","slc_a6312f686577e0eeb3414de23139ff4a581b661b2a37bd11866ec773cae5fd60","slc_ad117d95c30dddb42c889c9d1535fbc7a1cf0f44799895cb67b23a12b6149673"],"source_ids":["src_e71291c5e30b5f149db5da9d32b19cb8"],"text":"A Memory_service provides cross-session memory with a default SQLite+FTS5 backend, search modes (keyword, vector, hybrid with RRF, auto), and get_fn/upsert_fn for stable-ID plan-then-execute updates.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:07:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ef33a2981a9b4133bc896ec929d9d310"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:07:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_ef33a2981a9b4133bc896ec929d9d310","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4f835b48204545903ae290e8d4f5018038f42faac4ab64a3f60992ff22b6f2c8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"jcz2020/par@4b593db4465d snapshot 8335b6fb3b4903ae","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_119ae5115be5cf77c11b59ab95acd33fa1a65759207d08df80d91618a9709f3f","slc_e9ad46464b880fd080d97288c3cb5cf2ff3e3931e4b0615e7694bda3cf733127","slc_f5a6c40ffa2d47cda3b27edd4cbdb69f708ba6c7c7bf15b3b4e26d756323cd5d"],"source_ids":["src_05660ddbffd15a3db280352d74b41505"],"text":"The runtime exposes two API surfaces: an OCaml SDK (installed via opam pin) and Python bindings installable with pip as par-runtime.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:07:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ef33a2981a9b4133bc896ec929d9d310"}
